WEBVTT

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:02.567
and eventually divorced.

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:05.417
The actual events are pretty straightforward.

00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:07.865
At the age of 17,

00:01:07.865 --> 00:01:09.510
I got shot three times

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:14.135
standing on the corner of my block in Detroit.

00:01:14.135 --> 00:01:16.830
My friend rushed me to the hospital.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:20.054
Doctors pulled the bullets out,

00:01:20.054 --> 00:01:21.845
patched me up,

00:01:21.845 --> 00:01:26.216
and sent me back to the same 
neighborhood where I got shot.

00:01:26.216 --> 00:01:28.971
Throughout this ordeal,

00:01:28.971 --> 00:01:31.031
no one hugged me,